      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِيصٌ</span></b>  <i>A shining,</i> or <i>glistening;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَصِيصٌ</span>
(A, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِيقٌ</span>. (A.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A certain plant,
resembling the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُعْد</span> [or <i>cyperus</i>], (AA, K,) <i>growing in channels of running water.</i> (AA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبُو بَرِيصٍ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُرْصٌ</span>.

